  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mahesh Garg vs Dr. Sudam Pandharinath Khade ... on 1 February, 2024 Author: Chief Justice Bench: Ravi Malimath, Vijay Kumar Shukla 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Indore Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Ravi Malimath, Chief Justice & Hon'Ble Shri Justice Vijay Kumar Shukla On The 1 st Of February, 2024 Contempt Petition Civil No. 4850 of 2023 Between:- Mahesh Garg S/O Late Shri Rajkumar Garg, Aged About 71 Years, 16 Sanwad Nagar, Navalakha District Indore (Madhya Pradesh) ... (By Shri Pratyush Mishra - Advocate) And 1. Dr. Sudam Pandharinath Khade Commissioner Food Safety And Control Food And Durg Administration Idgaah Hills District Bhopal (Madhya Pradesh) 2. Mr. Iiayaraja T. , Collector Indore Collectorate, Moti Tabela, Indore (Madhya Pradesh) 3. MR. S.K. SUMAN, COLLECTOR JABALPUR COLLECTORATE CAMPUS ROAD, SOUTH CIVIL LINES, JABALPUR (MADHYA PRADESH) 4. MR. AKSHAY KUMAR SINGH, COLLECTOR G WA L I O R COLLECTOR, VIDHYA NAGAR, GWALIOR (MADHYA PRADESH) .....R ( S H R I BHUWAN DESHMUKH - GOVERNMENT ADVOCATE FOR RESPONDENT NO.1 AND SHRI ANAND BHATT - GOVERNMENT ADVOCATE FOR THE RESPONDENT NO.2) This petition coming on for admission this day, Hon'ble Mahesh Garg vs Dr. Sudam Pandharinath Khade ... on 1 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/65142622/ 1 Signature Not Verified Signed by: SANTOSH MASSEY Signing time: 01-02-2024 19:32:46 2 Ravi Malimath, Chief Justice passed the following: ORDER",
    "facts": "Now the only implementation is to be done in a time frame manner. So far as the construction of the Food Testing Laboratories at Jabalpur and Gwalior is concerned, there is no status report on record after allotment of the land. Since the Government has already taken a decision and process has already been initiated by allotment of land and sanctioning the fund, therefore, same can also be started and with the task to complete within a period of one year from today.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
