        "annotation_id": "7abfeb68678746eab7d68533f4385d52_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The contempt would arise only when there is a willful disobedience being committed by the accused."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "732647426a2d43a2aae004d0da64b280_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the instant case, in our considered view, the Court should not have passed an order directing compliance within a period of one year in a subject matter in which the Court is not an expert."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7f9ff54f09bb422da54cf1f68c6cf67d_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, to hold that the Court hopes and trusts that the respondents shall make efforts to complete the task by the end of the year 2022 is quite a different matter."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8652ee0aa5c14e7ca8ec45065cec785a_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There can be only way of persuasion so far as the issue is concerned."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e00857b061874e6a97ce86aa75cc640e_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In our considered view, there cannot be a direction to complete setting up of the food safety laboratories in a time that is specified by the Court itself."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b8cb626ed19e4186b57a92f33229187a_32",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, we do not find that any contempt would arise."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b1eb6073d4ff451bbed997245b296f8d_36",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThe petition is disposed off accordingly."
      }
    ],
